      "description": "Label, native numeric field and associated range hint; aria-invalid may be set to inspect the source error style.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label for=\"ds-center\">Центр X, px</label><input id=\"ds-center\" type=\"number\" value=\"500\" min=\"150\" max=\"850\" step=\"1\" aria-describedby=\"ds-center-range\"><span id=\"ds-center-range\" class=\"ds-field-hint\">150–850 px · синтетический пример</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:Noto,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#203733;background:#1d433c;color:#fff;padding:24px 28px}.ds-field label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px}.ds-field input{box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;min-height:52px;width:100%;max-width:100%;border:1px solid #91a69f;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:#203733;padding:9px 11px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;caret-color:#1b6687}.ds-field input[aria-invalid=true]{border:2px solid #a02e28;background:#fff5f3}.ds-field-hint{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#c2d5ca}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #277cad;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Masthead Account Region",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "masthead",
      "description": "Identity, native language choice and account actions; static controls carry no account commands.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-masthead\"><div class=\"ds-brand\"><span class=\"ds-brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>SahnaFrame</strong><span class=\"ds-edition\">v0.1</span></div><div class=\"ds-account\"><label for=\"ds-language\">Язык</label><select id=\"ds-language\"><option>RU</option><option>KK</option></select><button type=\"button\">Выйти</button></div></header>",
      "css": ".ds-masthead{font-family:Noto,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#203733;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:20px 40px;background:#1d433c;color:#fff;align-items:center}.ds-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:20px;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.6px}.ds-brand-mark{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;width:29px;height:26px}.ds-brand-mark i{width:7px;background:#d1e1da;height:26px}.ds-brand-mark i:nth-child(2){height:18px}.ds-brand-mark i:nth-child(3){height:22px}.ds-edition{font-size:12px;color:#bed0c8;letter-spacing:0;align-self:flex-end}.ds-account{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;font-size:12px}.ds-account label{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:12px}.ds-account select{font:inherit;min-height:44px;border:1px solid #91a69f;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:#203733;padding:5px 8px;max-width:100%;caret-color:#1b6687}.ds-account button{font:inherit;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #97aaa5;background:#fff;color:#203733;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600;min-height:44px;padding:6px 10px;background:transparent;border-color:#819d93;color:#fff;font-size:12px}.ds-account button:hover:not(:disabled){background:#e9eeec;border-color:#345c53}.ds-account button:hover{color:#203733}.ds-account button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}.ds-account select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #277cad;outline-offset:4px}.ds-account button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #277cad;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-masthead{padding:16px 20px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px}.ds-account{justify-content:flex-start;width:100%;gap:8px}.ds-brand{font-size:19px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Notice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "notice",
      "description": "Global informational field; add ds-notice-error to view the authored error variant.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-notice-context\"><div class=\"ds-notice\" role=\"status\" tabindex=\"-1\">Список обновлён. Живой файл, название и размещение этого аккаунта сохранены.</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-notice-context{font-family:Noto,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#203733}.ds-notice{padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #347d99;background:#e4edef;margin:20px 0 0;min-height:48px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-notice:empty{display:none}.ds-notice.ds-notice-error{border-color:#a02e28;background:#fae9e5;color:#7d2520}.ds-notice:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #277cad;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Saved Metadata Row",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "metadata-row",
      "description": "White immutable-set record with measurement, wrapped hash and native actions; fictional example content.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-set-row\"><div><h3>Синтетический набор</h3><p>60% · X 500 · Y 800 · demo · пример</p><p class=\"ds-fingerprint\">SHA256 52851229e201984f072b1da9291cd60df0f18e51288dfbe3431b612bbe238d76</p></div><div class=\"ds-set-actions\"><button type=\"button\">Открыть с тем же PNG</button><button type=\"button\" disabled>В архив</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-set-row{font-family:Noto,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#203733;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:24px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #c7d4c9;padding:20px;margin-bottom:8px}.ds-set-row h3{margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}.ds-set-row p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:12px}.ds-fingerprint{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;line-height:1.8;color:#5a6d63}.ds-set-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-content:start;justify-content:flex-end;max-width:260px}.ds-set-actions button{font:inherit;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #97aaa5;background:#fff;color:#203733;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600;font-size:12px}.ds-set-actions button:hover:not(:disabled){background:#e9eeec;border-color:#345c53}.ds-set-actions button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}.ds-set-actions button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #277cad;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-set-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;padding:18px}.ds-set-actions{max-width:none;justify-content:flex-start}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Comparison Proof Shell",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "scene-frame",
      "description": "Actual empty proof shell; the ds-selected class previews selection furniture without inventing a scene canvas.",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-scene\"><div class=\"ds-scene-caption\"><span>01</span><h2>Лён</h2></div><div class=\"ds-scene-view\"><p>Выберите PNG, чтобы увидеть сцену</p></div><figcaption><label class=\"ds-scene-choice\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-scene\"><span>Выбрать «Лён»</span></label><p>Тёплая плоскость, вертикальный акцент</p></figcaption></figure>",
      "css": ".ds-scene{font-family:Noto,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#203733;margin:0;min-width:0}.ds-scene-caption{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;border-top:2px solid #a1b4aa;padding:12px 0}.ds-scene-caption span{font-size:12px;color:#5e7569}.ds-scene-caption h2{margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.4px}.ds-scene-view{aspect-ratio:1;background:#e6ece7;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;border:1px solid #d1dcd3;outline:3px solid transparent;outline-offset:2px;transition:outline-color 180ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-scene-view p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#62766a;text-align:center;max-width:170px;line-height:1.7}.ds-scene.ds-selected .ds-scene-caption{border-color:#176a8e}.ds-scene.ds-selected .ds-scene-view{outline-color:#176a8e}.ds-scene-choice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:48px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.ds-scene-choice input{box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;border:1px solid #91a69f;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:#203733;max-width:100%;caret-color:#1b6687;width:19px;height:19px;min-height:19px;accent-color:#1b6687;padding:0;flex-shrink:0}.ds-scene figcaption>p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#5d7366}.ds-scene-choice input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #277cad;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-scene-caption h2{font-size:20px}.ds-scene-choice{font-size:14px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-scene-view{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Accepted Source Record",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "source-record",
      "description": "Measurement, alpha bounds and wrapped fingerprint beside the source control; fictional static data.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-source-record\"><p class=\"ds-source-hint\">Текущий принятый исходник.</p><p>120×160 px · PNG · 1038 bytes</p><p>Альфа-границы: 30,20 · 60×120 px</p><p class=\"ds-source-fingerprint\">SHA256 52851229e201984f072b1da9291cd60df0f18e51288dfbe3431b612bbe238d76</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-source-record{font-family:Noto,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#203733;font-size:13px;padding-left:24px;border-left:1px solid #d0d9d3}.ds-source-record p{margin:0}.ds-source-record p+p{margin-top:5px}.ds-source-hint{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#50675e}.ds-source-fingerprint{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;line-height:1.8;color:#5a6d63}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-source-record{padding-left:0;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #d0d9d3;padding-top:16px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Conservation mounting discipline",
    "overview": "SahnaFrame treats a composition as an inspectable mounting: quiet cool work ground, deep blue-green structural bands, and equally sized square proofs. The workhorse sans keeps labels and measurements close to their controls; scene artwork supplies the broader color range. The atmosphere is inferred from the committed direction contract and finished source, not owner visual approval.\n\nThe interface is flat and operational. A single common placement connects the comparison, while a lower white metadata list has a separate visual rhythm. The mounting metaphor describes the care and alignment; it does not introduce physical textures, archive stamps, or a new illustration style.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool pale work ground and green identity/placement bands.",
      "Equal square proofs with restrained lake-blue selection.",
      "Native rectangular controls, compact Noto labels, and explicit measurements.",
      "Flat borders and fields; fixed geometric scene artwork stays behind the subject."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Structural Green Rule",
        "body": "Use structural green for identity and shared-placement operations. Keep the fixed scene palettes in the artwork layer.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Measured Text Rule",
        "body": "Keep dimensions, alpha bounds, fingerprints, and preparation state readable as text beside their related task.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Common Baseline Rule",
        "body": "Compare complete square scenes with the same accepted subject geometry and baseline. Selection changes the proof outline rather than the subject scale.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Proof Rule",
        "body": "Use tonal fields and borders for interface separation. The authored scene ellipse is content, not an interface elevation token.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the green structural regions and cool work ground for the interface.",
      "Do keep the three proof frames equal and let the narrow layout stack them in source order.",
      "Do keep native labels, textual range hints, wrapped hashes, and visible focus beside their controls.",
      "Do distinguish previous accepted source data, selected scene, prepared export, and separate download actions."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't promote the fixed scene colors into global interface accents.",
      "Don't make a proof image or symbolic shadow cover the subject or hide the measurements.",
      "Don't replace the restrained interface fields with imitation texture, archive stamps, or decorative elevation.",
      "Don't turn numbered scene proof captions into generic section kickers."
    ]
  }
}
